Image IN ("*/PlistBuddy", "*/defaults", "*/plutil") CommandLine IN ("*RunAtLoad*", "*ProgramArguments*", "*StartCalendarInterval*", "*KeepAlive*", "*Label*", "*LaunchEvents*") OR CommandLine IN ("*/LaunchAgents*", "*/LaunchDaemons*", "*/Preferences/com.apple.loginitems.plist*", "*/Library/StartupItems*") ParentImage IN ("*/Safari.app/*", "*/Google Chrome.app/*", "*/Microsoft Word.app/*", "*/Terminal.app/*", "*/iTerm.app/*") OR NOT (Image IN ("/usr/sbin/softwareupdate*", "/System/Library/PrivateFrameworks/*") ParentImage IN ("/System/Library/CoreServices/*", "/usr/libexec/xpcproxy*"))
